{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured `/srv/data` as an XFS filesystem on LVM, captured a filesystem-consistent snapshot, modified the application data, and restored the exact earlier state. Boot-safe activation was configured and verified after reboot. CentOS Stream 10 and kernel 6.12.0-205.el10.x86_64 were retained.","actions_performed":["Created a dedicated 2 GiB LVM logical volume for `/srv/data` using existing compatible tooling.","Configured persistent loop-device activation and systemd mounting.","Created representative application data and recorded file and whole-tree SHA-256 baselines.","Created the `prechange` LVM snapshot while the filesystem was frozen.","Changed both original files and added a new post-snapshot file.","Merged the snapshot and verified the restored tree exactly matched the baseline; the added file disappeared.","Safely rebooted node1 once and verified changed boot identity, storage activation, mounted data, services, and identical content."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Keep application data under `/srv/data` on snapshot-capable storage","command_ids":["cmd-f3f5f8e9beb14261","cmd-d68d99941fb147d1","cmd-01424a5bd390414e"],"summary":"Shows the LVM PV/VG/LV, XFS filesystem mounted at `/srv/data`, application files, and persistent systemd/fstab configuration."},{"requirement":"Capture an earlier filesystem snapshot and demonstrate later modification","command_ids":["cmd-9098dd1cbab346ae","cmd-98c3d97d6cee46c3"],"summary":"Shows the filesystem-consistent `prechange` snapshot, baseline hashes, divergent modified hashes, and the additional post-snapshot file."},{"requirement":"Restore the exact content captured by the earlier snapshot","command_ids":["cmd-3f528721edd248aa","cmd-53451b0c8b9b48c6","cmd-8e2d423408ae4a58"],"summary":"Shows the snapshot merge reaching 100%, LV reactivation/remount, matching per-file and whole-tree hashes, restored original content, and removal of post-snapshot data."},{"requirement":"Retain the installed operating-system release and kernel","command_ids":["cmd-d3c56f54ef664bdc","cmd-06d5e8df232c4ff0"],"summary":"Before and after evidence shows CentOS Stream 10 with kernel 6.12.0-205.el10.x86_64."},{"requirement":"node1 mandatory restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-1f4cc6d93e054756","cmd-8468ba06fe504bd6","cmd-5ea1086f44d24eeb","cmd-3ff4d407b92b4cec","cmd-06d5e8df232c4ff0"],"summary":"Captures healthy pre-restart data with boot ID df8bab0d-5c09-47a2-a150-4ce12d0f9549, safe reboot acknowledgement, changed boot ID a5f00a13-77f6-4315-a515-16f0ea1797f8, recovered services and mount, and byte-identical application data after reboot."}]}
